From 843828a949835285cd8768f20351dd5d15cf0406 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: YunPin contributors <noreply@yunpin.invalid>
Date: Thu, 6 Aug 2026 22:31:38 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] yunpin: isolate preview identity and IPC

SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-only

Upstream-Base: rime/weasel@9cc96e20dc71b80876b12f689bb5863c76c2a7ed

Give the TSF, registry, IPC objects, runtime paths and Rime application a separate YunPin identity. Disable WinSparkle update calls and narrow the named-pipe DACL to SYSTEM, the current user and app-container read/write access. This is an ACL boundary, not cryptographic client authentication.
